# "> Generated:" wall clock, not the source commit SHA, so they cannot be regenerated; they are
# preserved out-of-repo in Dropbox /ConvoPeq-snapshots-20261026 (verified: size + content_hash,
# 23/23). Ignoring them keeps git status clean and prevents an accidental `git add -A`; Git does
